        <p>This independent Macro Weekly analysis is for educational and informational purposes. It is not financial, investment, trading, legal or tax advice; not a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any asset; and not a live market analysis or independently verified original USD Impact Score. Relationships between macro releases and prices are conditional and may change.</p>
